  "scope": "Isolated new bounded128-edge cross-node gather/prefetch before exact original-order relaxations, original32-item/band64 and12 query workers. Buffer stores values/indices only, no map references across grow. Each source stale check occurs at consumption before its first edge; mid-node flush rechecks a label that nonnegative self-edges cannot decrease. Arbitrary degrees flush bounded scratch. Original all widths/sidecars/heap/labels remain; new helper prefetch computes only an in-range bucket. Distinct from old100 one-next-neighbor prefetch and284 two-query-context interleaving. Requires native screening then new partial-buffer/growth/stale/self-loop/Floyd/full64/native-GCC strict/race/image/default/real K proof before promotion. No source/harness/counter/identity/host changes.",
